<title>USA: MBIA qualfies 17 muni issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualfies 17 muni issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Tuesday it qualified for bond insurance the following 17 municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Van Buren School District No 42, Ark., $4.15 million construction bonds.</p>
</text>
